    2: "<p>Hi {{Name}},</p>\n\n<p>Just checking in one more time.</p>\n\n<p>Many automotive businesses assume that improving response times and cutting service admin requires new software or a large transformation project. In reality, automating one repetitive process such as enquiry response and lead qualification, service scheduling and follow up, and warranty and parts documentation saves hours every week. Every enquiry gets answered within minutes and your service bays stay booked without more people on the phone.</p>\n\n<p>That capacity does not disappear, it moves. The people doing that work today go back to sales, service bays and parts, which is where your return actually comes from.</p>\n\n<p>We're happy to identify one opportunity and build it for you at no cost. Nothing changes in how your team works, the output just arrives. You only move forward if it delivers value.</p>\n\n<p>The gap between businesses running on AI and businesses running on people isn't closing, it's widening. It widens quietly, which is what makes it easy to miss until a competitor prices or delivers in a way you cannot match.</p>\n\n<p>If you'd like to explore one automation opportunity for your business, you can grab a slot on my calendar: <a href=\"https://uniligence.com/discovery-call\">Grab a slot</a></p>\n\n<p>Best,<br>Mahidhar<br>Growth &amp; Operations<br><a href=\"https://uniligence.com/\">Uniligence</a></p>\n",
